WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.739 --> 00:00:06.077
When something makes you anxious, avoiding it can feel like a relief.

2
00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:11.720
Maybe you skip a social invitation because you’re worried about an awkward

3
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.146
conversation.

4
00:00:12.146 --> 00:00:15.386
In the moment, staying home feels easier.

5
00:00:15.908 --> 00:00:20.275
Sometimes, though, repeatedly avoiding a feared situation can make it harder

6
00:00:20.275 --> 00:00:21.070
to return.

7
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:25.834
You may have fewer chances to learn how you could handle it.

8
00:00:26.356 --> 00:00:31.067
That doesn’t mean you should force yourself into the hardest situation—or

9
00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:33.637
enter a situation that is unsafe.

10
00:00:34.158 --> 00:00:38.089
A small, manageable step may be a better place to begin.

11
00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:43.265
For example, after an uncomfortable conversation, you might consider a brief

12
00:00:43.265 --> 00:00:47.497
call with someone you trust rather than a large gathering.

13
00:00:48.018 --> 00:00:53.027
Take a moment to think about one safe, low-pressure step you could consider.

14
00:00:53.027 --> 00:00:55.897
Or think of someone you could ask for support.

15
00:00:56.419 --> 00:00:58.557
You don’t need to act on it right now.

16
00:00:59.078 --> 00:01:02.122
Getting support is also a meaningful step.

17
00:01:02.122 --> 00:01:07.855
If anxiety keeps affecting your sleep, relationships, work, school, or

18
00:01:07.855 --> 00:01:13.015
everyday activities, consider talking with a qualified mental health

19
00:01:13.015 --> 00:01:13.589
professional.

20
00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:18.340
They can help you understand what’s happening and choose an approach suited to

21
00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:18.666
you.

22
00:01:19.188 --> 00:01:22.475
Progress doesn’t have to mean feeling no anxiety.

23
00:01:22.475 --> 00:01:26.788
It can mean making space for something that matters to you, with support when

24
00:01:26.788 --> 00:01:27.712
you need it.

25
00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:30.625
You don’t have to handle everything alone.
